Scriptname SonOfATripping extends MCM_ConfigBase
{ Son of a! - Tripping (addon) -- MCM registration.

  Intentionally empty. Extending MCM Helper's MCM_ConfigBase is what registers
  this addon with SkyUI and makes the menu appear; MCM Helper matches this
  script's name to Data\MCM\Config\SonOfATripping\config.json and renders it.
  All the actual gameplay lives in _SoaTripController, which is attached to the
  same quest. }
